[node name="RichTextLabelPreperation" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container/GridContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(333, 300)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 4
size_flags_vertical = 4
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_5hmeh")
theme_override_fonts/bold_font = ExtResource("3_s3moe")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]Preperation:[/b][/font_size]

Determine whether to play with the basic question set and filter out this set if necessary. Complex question cards are marked (+).

Stack the cards by color and number order for question & answer cards.
Mix action cards randomly through each set of game cards.

If a screen is present, the questions can be shown on the screen during the game"

[node name="RichTextLabelCourseOfPlay" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container/GridContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(333, 300)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 4
size_flags_vertical = 4
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_5hmeh")
theme_override_fonts/bold_font = ExtResource("3_s3moe")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]Course of Play:[/b][/font_size]

Answer right: Player keeps the new position.
Answer wrong: Player returns to the original
position.

Place the answered cards in the discard pile.

Play in clockwise order for the next turn.
At the interrupt alarm, the player rolls the dice and performs the corresponding task (see back cover)."

[node name="RichTextLabelTollgates" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container/GridContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(333, 300)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 4
size_flags_vertical = 4
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_5hmeh")
theme_override_fonts/bold_font = ExtResource("3_s3moe")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]Tollgates:[/b][/font_size]

Take a card from the pile belonging to the square you finished on and read it out loud. (Participants can read along via screen or answer booklet).

Did you land on a question card? If so, then answer the question.

Do you draw an action card? Then you perform the action on the card.

[b]Note![/b] Interrupt can go off at any time!"

[node name="RichTextLabelFinish" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container/GridContainer"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(333, 300)
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 4
size_flags_vertical = 4
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_5hmeh")
theme_override_fonts/bold_font = ExtResource("3_s3moe")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]Finish:[/b][/font_size]

When your first pawn crosses the finish line, answer
the question associated with this toll gate. If your answer is correct, you are finished with your first pawn.

Then continue playing with the second pawn.
The game can be played at your discretion for a certain time block."

[node name="RichTextLabelInterruptAlarm" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/Container/GridContainer"]
