theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]Start the Game:[/b][/font_size]

All players start in the PLAN phase after rolling the
dice.
Player rolls the dice and moves the pawn a number
of squares that the dice indicates.

The first step is to put the pawn on the board."

